See also |Button Shields| in Bridle and Zephyr sample:
:zephyr:code-sample:`button`.

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/button
      :build-dir: coffeecaller_nrf52
      :board: coffeecaller_nrf52/nrf52840
      :shield: "grove_btn_d16_inv grove_led_d17 x_grove_testbed"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

You should see the following message on the console:

   .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

      .. parsed-literal::

         \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
         Press the button
         Button 34 pressed at 98894
         Button 34 released at 106373
         Button 34 pressed at 114583
         Button 34 released at 119888
         Button 34 pressed at 126341
         Button 34 released at 131842
         Button 34 pressed at 138404
         Button 34 released at 143044
         Button … … …
